[h1]NS2 Improved Web Admin {version} (beta)[/h1]

A modern replacement for the dedicated server's web admin panel: a new front end plus a corrected [b]lua/ServerWebInterface.lua[/b], in one server mod. No game files are edited.

[b]Read this first.[/b] This mod is a beta. It was written by an AI coding assistant, directed and reviewed by a human. It is provided [b]as is, with no warranty[/b]. It runs Lua inside your game server and changes how the server handles bans, reserved slots and the map cycle. Test it on a server you can afford to break, and keep backups of your config.

[h2]What it does[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Players:[/b] kick, ban, slay, move, eject, mute, round controls; Hive skill with the game's skill badges; IPs and Steam ids masked until asked.
[*][b]Recent players:[/b] everyone seen in the last 24 hours, so a player who left can still be banned.
[*][b]Bans and Reserved Slots:[/b] what the server actually enforces, Shine's when its plugins are on.
[*][b]Chat:[/b] read with team and time, and send to all, marines or aliens.
[*][b]Maps:[/b] edit the map cycle by drag and drop, written at once and undoable; Shine's options and mapvote respected.
[*][b]Mods and Workshop:[/b] what is mounted now, whether each mod is on the ranked whitelist, and Workshop search and install.
[*][b]Performance:[/b] what perfmon and the engine's tickstat measure, charted over time.
[*][b]Console:[/b] the server's own log, filtered and coloured, with a command line that shows what each command printed.
[/list]
It never reports success it has not verified, and fetches nothing from a third party at runtime except Workshop thumbnails, which Settings turns off. Vanilla and Shine servers are both supported.

[h2]Install[/h2]
{if-no-id}Add this item's id (the number in this page's address) to [b]mods[/b] in your server's [b]MapCycle.json[/b], then change map or restart. Open the web admin as before, at [b]/index.html[/b] on the web admin port.
{if-id}Add [b]{hexid}[/b] (this item's id, {id}, in hex) to [b]mods[/b] in your server's [b]MapCycle.json[/b], then change map or restart. Open the web admin as before, at [b]/index.html[/b] on the web admin port.

[h2]Costs[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]The server is unranked[/b] while this mod is mounted, as with any mod not on the ranked whitelist.
[*]Players joining the server download the mod once (under 1 MB).
[/list]

[h2]Security[/h2]
The engine's web admin speaks [b]plain HTTP[/b], with or without this mod: player names, Steam ids, IPs, chat and every admin command cross the network in the clear. [b]Do not expose the web admin port to the internet.[/b] Bind it to loopback with [b]-webdomain 127.0.0.1[/b] and reach it through an SSH tunnel or an HTTPS reverse proxy. Details in [url=https://github.com/LZZZZ/ns2-improved-web-admin/blob/master/docs/SECURITY.md]docs/SECURITY.md[/url].

